      "title_sha256_16": "e098da05b271e5f5",
      "title_text": "Output GST head balances and the configured GST payment ledger, reported as plain Trial Balance figures",
      "limits_sha256_16": "9282c5f01d20ee93",
      "limits_text": [
        "The books do not show whether a monthly journal actually set off input credit against output liability; a large, growing balance on an output-tax ledger alongside all payments running through one ledger is consistent with the set-off never having been journalised, so the balances are accumulated gross amounts, but that reading needs the CA's own judgement on this data."
      ],
      "ask_client_sha256_16": "c34e3d2795e803a5",
      "ask_client_text": [
        "Confirm whether the monthly GST liability was set off against input credit by journal entry, and if so, ask for those entries."
      ]
